<%
  const title = 'Booking Terms — Grand Aurelia Hotel & Resort';
  const metaDescription = 'Terms of use and booking conditions for the Grand Aurelia demonstration website.';
%>
<%- include('partials/head') %>

<section class="simple-page">
  <div class="container">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="color:var(--muted);">
      <a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Booking Terms</span>
    </nav>
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Booking <em>terms.</em></h1>
    <div class="simple-content">
      <p><strong>Last updated: November 2026.</strong> These terms describe how reservations work on this demonstration website. Grand Aurelia is a fictional hotel; no real accommodation, transport or payment is provided.</p>

      <h2>1. The demonstration</h2>
      <p>Every booking, guest, room, price, review and member of staff shown on this website is fictional. The site exists to demonstrate a complete hotel booking experience. It must not be used to make real reservations or payments.</p>

      <h2>2. Reservations and confirmation</h2>
      <p>A reservation is created when you complete the booking form and receive a unique reference beginning with <strong>GA-</strong>. Your confirmation page and printable summary are the record of the demonstration booking. A confirmation is also stored in the admin dashboard.</p>
      <p>Rates are quoted per room, per night, in Pakistani Rupees, exclusive of the service charge and GST shown at checkout. Extras, dining plans and transfers are added to the total before taxes.</p>

      <h2>3. Availability and double bookings</h2>
      <p>Availability is calculated from the demonstration room inventory and existing reservations. The booking engine re-checks availability inside a database transaction before confirming, so two guests cannot be assigned the same physical room for overlapping dates. If a room becomes unavailable while you are booking, you will be asked to choose another category or adjust your dates.</p>

      <h2>4. Payment</h2>
      <p>Three demonstration payment methods are offered: pay at the hotel, a simulated card payment, and pay at check-out. The simulated card method performs format validation only. No card details are stored and no charge is made. Bookings paid by card are marked as paid in the demo; other methods are marked as pending until an administrator changes the status.</p>

      <h2>5. Cancellation</h2>
      <p>Flexible demonstration rates may be cancelled up to 48 hours before arrival. Promotional and advance-purchase rates may be shown as non-refundable. Cancellations can be simulated by the hotel administrator in the dashboard; no money changes hands.</p>

      <h2>6. Arrival and departure</h2>
      <p>Check-in begins at <%= settings.checkin_time %> and check-out is by <%= settings.checkout_time %>. Early arrival, late departure, airport transfers and accessibility requirements can be noted in the special requests field or arranged through the guest services page.</p>

      <h2>7. Guest conduct</h2>
      <p>We ask guests to respect the quiet of the gardens and the comfort of other guests. The hotel may decline a demonstration booking that contains abusive or unlawful content. Enquiry and request messages are stored for review in the admin dashboard.</p>

      <h2>8. Liability</h2>
      <p>This website is provided "as is" for demonstration and educational purposes. No warranty is made about availability, pricing or fitness for a particular purpose, and no liability is accepted for any loss arising from use of the demo.</p>

      <h2>9. Governing law</h2>
      <p>These fictional terms are presented under the laws of Pakistan for realism. They do not create a binding contract for accommodation.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms can be sent to <a href="mailto:<%= settings.email %>"><%= settings.email %></a>. Our privacy practices are described in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>

      <p style="margin-top:34px;"><a class="text-link" href="/booking">Return to reservations <i data-lucide="arrow-up-right" class="icon-xs"></i></a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
